lecules in one centimeter cubed of air, and their average distance apart is 3.6 × 10^-7 centimeters.", "expert_answer": "(H) 2.7 × 10^19 molecules, 3.6 × 10^-7 centimetres.", "expert_latency_s": 4.31, "stall_ms": 33, "relay_ms": 1323}
